          "reply": "\"Evenin' to ye,\" I greet the stranger as they step into the pub. \"Name's Padraig Darcy, I run this place. Welcome to Darcy's Pub.\" I wipe down the bar top with a cloth, eyeing the newcomer curiously. \"What'll it be then? Whiskey, ale, or perhaps a sup of poitin to warm yer bones on this fine evenin'?\" I add with a gruff chuckle.",
          "response_sha256": "92142f4eddf253124af38316c8daf2f950a15b897691e659ef73660278c29fda",
          "cache_key": "4f75ae63c76c1f642d40c823321df218ae1a2d1da5605c45f11704618ab4aee6",
